What should be the value of $$\lambda $$ such that the function defined below is continuous at $$x = {\pi  \over 2}$$?
<br>$$f\left( x \right) = \left\{ {\matrix{
   {{{\lambda \,\cos x} \over {{\pi  \over 2} - x}},} &amp; {if\,\,x \ne {\pi  \over 2}}  \cr 
   {1\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,,} &amp; {if\,\,x = {\pi  \over 2}}  \cr 

 } } \right.$$
